---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';

const title = 'Best Free Live Cam Sites in 2026: What “Free” Actually Means';
const description = 'Compare free-access live cam models and understand where optional token spending begins.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pageType="Article">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/live-cams">Live Cams</a><span>/</span><span>Best Free Live Cam Sites</span></nav>
      <span class="kicker">Free-access search intent · September 2026</span>
      <h1>Best Free Live Cam Sites</h1>
      <p class="lead">“Free” usually means you can browse or watch public rooms without paying. It does not mean every interaction, tip or private feature is free.</p>
      <div class="disclosure"><strong>Affiliate disclosure:</strong> Stripchat is StripUnion’s current commercial partner and our primary monetized recommendation for users who want a public-room-first experience.</div>
      <AffiliateButton source="best_free_live_cams_hero" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell narrow">
    <div class="take-box"><span class="kicker">Best fit for free-first browsing</span><p>If your main goal is to explore public rooms before deciding whether to spend, Stripchat’s public-room model fits that intent well.</p></div>

    <section class="article-body">
      <section><h2>Free browsing and paid interaction are different layers</h2><p>A strong free-first platform lets you understand the environment before payment. The monetized layer starts when you choose tokens, tips, private interaction or other paid features.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Do not compare “free” claims without asking what is gated</h2><p>Registration requirements, messaging, private shows and other interactive features can differ. The useful question is not whether the homepage says “free,” but what you can actually do before buying anything.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Why StripUnion does not send you to every free competitor</h2><p>We can compare competitor models inside StripUnion without handing away the commercial value of the visitor. Until another platform has an approved affiliate relationship, the actionable third-party route remains Stripchat.</p></section>
    </section>

    <section class="conversion-strip">
      <div><span class="kicker">Free-first partner option</span><h2>Browse Stripchat before deciding whether to spend.</h2><p>Use the tracked partner route to see the current public-room experience.</p></div>
      <AffiliateButton source="best_free_live_cams_bottom" />
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
